    "detailed_description": "&quot;Bunny Space Odyssey: The Countdown&quot; is a hidden objects game: you need to find 100 eared helmets.<br>Explore the scientist's lab, find all the bunny helmets, and start delving into the story of the hopping pixel universe.<br>Just click on the helmet if you find it - and the countdown will begin! Make sure to catch everything! <br><br>&quot;Bunny Space Odyssey: The Countdown&quot; can be considered a prequel to the big story of the planet FlopHop, so you can also discover parts of the bunny world narration while searching for the helmets. <br>Click on those items where the cursor becomes a magnifying glass instead of a carrot - and you will learn more about the Bunny Space Odyssey world.<br>Will rabbits fly away from Earth, where life is becoming dangerous? Are you ready to embark on this mission?<br><br>Get achievements for finding helmets, reading lore, playing with the timer and setting new records! Is everybunn ready?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954420/extras/417d47d957af1d7e8ff2a1c0ba8b8f3e.avif?t=1726940583\" width=616 height=78 /></span><br>Find the link under the 'Basic Info' tab and join the AinkOink Discord Server!",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Bunny Space Odyssey: The Countdown&quot; is a hidden objects game: you need to find 100 eared helmets.<br>Explore the scientist's lab, find all the bunny helmets, and start delving into the story of the hopping pixel universe.<br>Just click on the helmet if you find it - and the countdown will begin! Make sure to catch everything! <br><br>&quot;Bunny Space Odyssey: The Countdown&quot; can be considered a prequel to the big story of the planet FlopHop, so you can also discover parts of the bunny world narration while searching for the helmets. <br>Click on those items where the cursor becomes a magnifying glass instead of a carrot - and you will learn more about the Bunny Space Odyssey world.<br>Will rabbits fly away from Earth, where life is becoming dangerous? Are you ready to embark on this mission?<br><br>Get achievements for finding helmets, reading lore, playing with the timer and setting new records! Is everybunn ready?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954420/extras/417d47d957af1d7e8ff2a1c0ba8b8f3e.avif?t=1726940583\" width=616 height=78 /></span><br>Find the link under the 'Basic Info' tab and join the AinkOink Discord Server!",
